d community programs for youth","x":275,"y":721,"w":1853,"h":47},{"text":"and seniors. However, the growing number of visitors who stay in our community has added","x":276,"y":785,"w":1776,"h":46},{"text":"pressure onto our streets, sidewalks, and public safety services.","x":275,"y":849,"w":1210,"h":47},{"text":"These community spaces, streets, and sidewalks now require ongoing maintenance that is beyond","x":276,"y":944,"w":1871,"h":48},{"text":"current available resources. If we don't address these issues now, they will be more expensive to","x":276,"y":1009,"w":1861,"h":46},{"text":"repair and maintain in the future.","x":276,"y":1075,"w":629,"h":46},{"text":"Burlingame's hotel tax rate is currently among the lowest in the County and has not been","x":277,"y":1170,"w":1708,"h":47},{"text":"ensures that hotel guests help fund","x":1447,"y":1233,"w":661,"h":46},{"text":"increased in more than 17 years. Voting YES on Measure","x":277,"y":1235,"w":1096,"h":46},{"text":"the services they use, so local homeowners and residents don't bear the full cost.","x":276,"y":1298,"w":1546,"h":47},{"text":"Well-maintained streets, safe sidewalks, and clean parks protect Burlingame's quality of life and","x":278,"y":1393,"w":1847,"h":46},{"text":"help preserve property values.","x":276,"y":1459,"w":577,"h":47},{"text":"Measure Does Not Increase Taxes for Local Residents","x":277,"y":1555,"w":1153,"h":37},{"text":"ensures our hotel guests pay their fair share for city services","x":659,"y":1652,"w":1151,"h":48},{"text":"Measure","x":421,"y":1657,"w":164,"h":35},{"text":"The state and federal government cannot take one penny of Measure","x":421,"y":1720,"w":1314,"h":48},{"text":"Independent citizens' oversight and annual financial audits are required","x":422,"y":1787,"w":1369,"h":49},{"text":"Vote YES on : Keep Burlingame Safe and Desirable","x":278,"y":1885,"w":1103,"h":46},{"text":"Repair and maintain streets, sidewalks, and potholes","x":422,"y":1983,"w":1005,"h":49},{"text":"8","x":1345,"y":2047,"w":43,"h":57},{"text":"Maintain parks and healthy trees on city streets","x":423,"y":2052,"w":903,"h":48},{"text":"Strengthen emergency preparedness and public safety","x":424,"y":2118,"w":1029,"h":49},{"text":"9","x":1662,"y":2169,"w":40,"h":60},{"text":"Support recreation programs and facilities for youth and seniors","x":425,"y":2185,"w":1223,"h":49},{"text":"Safe neighborhoods, beautiful parks and clean streets make Burlingame a desirable place to live,","x":280,"y":2279,"w":1852,"h":52},{"text":"do business, and raise a family.","x":279,"y":2348,"w":596,"h":45},{"text":"to protect our community and keep Burlingame","x":1204,"y":2438,"w":910,"h":48},{"text":"Join local leaders in voting Yes on Measure","x":279,"y":2443,"w":852,"h":45},{"text":"Strong.","x":281,"y":2509,"w":136,"h":45},{"text":"RECEIVED","x":1818,"y":2699,"w":335,"h":49},{"text":"AUG 06 2026","x":1850,"y":2802,"w":263,"h":53},{"text":"CLERK'S OFFICE","x":1888,"y":2895,"w":285,"h":30},{"text":"CITY OF BURLINGAME","x":1800,"y":2930,"w":377,"h":33}]}]}
